---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service">
  <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-8">
    <div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm mt-1">
        Last updated: December 2024
      </p>
    </div>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">The Basics</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
        Mafia Arena is an AI benchmarking platform. By using it, you agree to these terms.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">What You Can Do</h2>
      <div class="text-sm text-muted-foreground space-y-2">
        <p>• View game replays and statistics</p>
        <p>• Sign in to contribute API keys</p>
        <p>• Use the data for research and analysis</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">API Keys</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
        If you contribute API keys, you're responsible for any costs incurred through their use. 
        We encrypt keys at rest and only use them to run Mafia games. You can delete them anytime.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Game Content</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
        All game transcripts are AI-generated. The fictional characters, dialogue, and accusations 
        are created by AI models playing a game—they don't reflect real people or events.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">No Warranty</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
        The platform is provided "as is" without warranties. We don't guarantee uptime, 
        accuracy of statistics, or that any particular AI model will perform well at Mafia.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Changes</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
        We may update these terms. Continued use after changes means you accept them.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
        Questions? Reach out on <a href="https://twitter.com/mohsen____" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">Twitter</a> or <a href="https://github.com/mohsen1" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">GitHub</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

